          "text" : "Discussion",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "The identifier is reproduced in the results of a recorder created from this configuration. In fact, the only way to link a result",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "(an ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "code" : "ORKFileResult",
              "type" : "codeVoice"
            },
            {
              "text" : " object) to the recorder that generated it is to look at the value of",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "code" : "identifier",
              "type" : "codeVoice"
            },
            {
              "text" : ". To accurately identify recorder results, you need to ensure that recorder identifiers",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "are unique within each step.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "In some cases, it can be useful to link the recorder identifier to a unique identifier in a",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "database; in other cases, it can make sense to make the identifier human",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "readable.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "kind" : "content"
    }
